          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: le jardinage",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "le jardinage — \"gardening\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Le jardinage me détend après le travail. Gardening relaxes me after work."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Faire du jardinage — to do some gardening."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "le jardinage is built on jardin \"garden\" with -age; jardin goes back to Frankish gardo \"an enclosure\", a Germanic word."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
